# A bandit's hit cuts the drink: no heal, the potion stays in the bag (part A).
put-at player 61737 2198 -13323
put-at BDT_1013_BANDIT_L 61796 2195 -13461
face npc BDT_1013_BANDIT_L
healing begin hit-1h ItPo_Health_01 600
healing arm 1h
